🎓 DecentraLearn: Stake-to-Learn Protocol A decentralized educational platform on Cardano where students stake ADA to commit to learning, and educators verify progress on-chain.

DecentraLearn gamifies education by requiring a financial commitment (stake) from the student. As they pass quizzes and complete lessons, an educator (or oracle) verifies their progress on the blockchain. Upon graduation, the student reclaims their stake plus earned rewards, while the educator receives a service fee.

🌐 Live Demo: https://learn-to-earn-seven.vercel.app

✨ Features
🔒 Stake-to-Learn Model: Students must lock ADA to enroll, ensuring commitment.
✅ Educator Verification: Lesson progress is cryptographically signed and updated on-chain by the educator.
🧬 Inline Datum: All course progress (lessons completed, notes) is stored directly on the UTXO.
🎮 Gamification: Built-in XP system, levels, and badge unlocking based on chain state.
⚡ Lucid SDK: Fully client-side interaction using the latest Lucid 0.10+ stack.
💰 Automated Payouts: Smart contract handles the distribution of Stake (Student), Rewards (Student), and Fees (Educator).
