🚀 How to Use
1. Connect Wallet
Click the "Connect Wallet" button. The app will initialize Lucid, connect to Blockfrost, and derive the Smart Contract address.

2. Browse & Enroll
Navigate to the Catalog.
Select a course (e.g., Intro to Cardano).
Action: Click "Enroll & Stake".
On-Chain: This locks your Stake + Educator Fee + Reward Buffer into the script address with a specific Datum.
3. Learn & Quiz
Watch the lesson content.
Take the multiple-choice quiz.
Action: Upon passing, the system requests a transaction.
Note: In this demo, the connected wallet acts as both Student and Educator ("Self-Taught Mode") to sign the verification.
4. Educator Verification
Navigate to the Educator Dashboard.
Scan for students enrolled in your courses.
Action: Click "Verify Lesson" to update the student's on-chain datum (increment lessonsDone).
5. Graduate & Claim
Once lessonsDone equals totalLessons (10/10):
Action: Click "Graduate & Claim".
On-Chain: The script validates completion, returns the Stake + Rewards to the Student, and sends the Fee to the Educator.
🧠 Smart Contract & Data Structure
Network: Cardano Preprod Validator: Plutus V2

💾 Datum Schema (State)
The state of every enrollment is stored publicly on-chain:

const EduDatum = Data.Object({
    student: Data.Bytes(),         // Student's PubKeyHash
    educator: Data.Bytes(),        // Educator's PubKeyHash
    stakeAmount: Data.Integer(),   // Lovelace staked by student
    educatorFee: Data.Integer(),   // Fee reserved for educator
    lessonsDone: Data.Integer(),   // Current progress (0-10)
    totalLessons: Data.Integer(),  // Target lessons
    rewardPerLesson: Data.Integer(), // Reward accumulated per lesson
    lessonNotes: Data.Array(Data.Bytes()) // Optional metadata
});
⚙️ Redeemers (Actions)
The smart contract handles three specific state transitions:

Action	Index	Description
Enroll	Constr(0)	Creates the initial UTXO with the student/educator configuration.
Complete	Constr(1)	Requires Educator Signature. Increments lessonsDone. Checks that other fields remain unchanged.
Claim	Constr(2)	Requires Student Signature. Validates that lessonsDone == totalLessons. Splits the UTXO value between Student and Educator.
🧪 Testing Checklist
Enrollment:
Verify funds leave wallet.
Verify Script Address receives UTXO with correct Inline Datum.
Progress:
Complete a quiz.
Verify the "Verify Lesson" transaction updates lessonsDone in the Datum (visible on Explorer).
Gamification:
Check that XP bar increases in the UI after verification.
Graduation:
Ensure "Graduate" button only appears after Lesson 10.
Verify the final transaction consumes the script UTXO and distributes funds correctly.
🔧 Configuration
To run this locally, ensure your BLOCKFROST_KEY is set in the code:

const BLOCKFROST_URL = "https://cardano-preprod.blockfrost.io/api/v0";
const BLOCKFROST_KEY = "YOUR_PREPROD_KEY_HERE";
Note: The script CBOR provided in the source is a pre-compiled Plutus binary. Ensure you are using the matching Datum structure, or validation will fail.

